# Português (Brasil) (Brazilian Portuguese) language pack for MXBMRP3 - BETA.
# Drafted for 1.35; not yet reviewed line by line by a native speaker.
# Corrections are welcome: see README.md in the parent folder. The folder is
# "pt", so Portuguese Windows in Portugal picks it too; a pt-pt pack can sit
# on top of it with base = pt.
#
# Glossary (keep these consistent):
#   rider = piloto, bike = moto, lap = volta, sector = setor, split = parcial,
#   gap = dif. / diferença, PB = RP / recorde pessoal, standings = classificação,
#   pits = boxes, penalty = punição, session = sessão, practice = treino,
#   qualify = classificação, race = corrida, settings = ajustes / configurações,
#   hotkeys = atalhos, rumble = vibração, notice = aviso, achievement = conquista,
#   profile = perfil, crash = queda, web overlay = overlay web,
#   On/Off = On/Off, Default = Padrão, Auto = Auto.
#   Kept in English as players say them: HUD, Dash, Companion, holeshot, whip,
#   scrub, oppo, endo, stoppie, wheelie, backflip, frontflip, turn down, FMX, OBS.
